<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;color:#1B6EA0;">Session cancelled</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Dear {{firstName}}, we're sorry to say that <strong>{{eventName}}</strong> on {{eventDate}} has been cancelled.</p>
{{#if reason}}<p style="margin:0 0 16px;padding:12px 16px;background:#EDF2F7;border-radius:12px;color:#5E6E7E;"><strong>Reason:</strong> {{reason}}</p>{{/if}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Your enrollment has been released and no action is needed from you. We'd love to see you at a future session.</p>
<p style="margin:0;"><a href="{{webUrl}}/app/events" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2691D0,#1B6EA0);color:#fff;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;">Browse other sessions</a></p>
